Godot v4.6.dev1 - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 22 Sep 2025 22:08:35 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (nvidia; 580.82.09) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 46.81 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm not sure if this is working as intended and so this should be a proposal, but for some reason, the switch editor tab shortcut doesn't allow key echo. This makes it quite annoying to switch tabs quickly, as I've tuned my key repeat settings in my window manager specifically so that they repeat faster and make stuff like this easier.\n\nTo make matters worse, since it doesn't allow echo, the editor itself ends up eating the input and inserting a bunch of `<<<<<<<<<` or `>>>>>>>>` into my code.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTry holding <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+,</kbd> or <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+.</kbd> to switch script editor tabs.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1115